===== README.md (Scaffold) =====
# todos-client

A typed Rust client for the **Todos 1.2.3** RPC, generated by `leptoskit rpc generate --target rust`.

It speaks the RPC's own protocol over `reqwest` — the same routes and encodings the app uses — and depends on neither leptos nor `leptoskit_rpc`. Bring your own async runtime.

## Usage

```rust
let api = todos_client::Client::with_server_url("https://todos.example");
let result = api.list_todos(/* ... */, /* ... */).await?;
```

Errors are [`Error::Fn`] carrying an `FnErrorKind` of `Network`, `Invalid`, `Server`, `Decode`, or `Other`, mirroring the server's classification; `retryable` is true only for network failures. Shapes the generator cannot model (unrecognized unions) appear as `serde_json::Value`.
